@host = http://localhost:5102
@tripId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@date = {{$datetime iso8601 "yyyy-MM-dd" "+1 day"}}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. Buscar viagens
GET {{host}}/api/trips?from=Sao Paulo&to=Rio de Janeiro&date={{date}}

### 2. Mapa de assentos
GET {{host}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/seats

### 3. Reservar assento (substitua seatId pelo retorno do passo 2)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "seatId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "userId": "user-demo-001"
}

### 4. Criar pedido (substitua reservationId)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "passengers": [
    { "fullName": "Joao Silva", "documentNumber": "12345678900" }
  ]
}

### 5. Pagar e emitir bilhete (substitua orderId)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-001"
}

### 5b. Simular falha de pagamento (libera assento via saga)
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-fail-001",
  "simulateFailure": true
}
